{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>Throughout your borders.</b> Now, regarding the Sabbath, Scripture warns concerning your stranger who is within your gates, for on this condition he may dwell within your gates: that he do no work before you on the Sabbath. And likewise on the Day of Atonement, for thus it is written. And likewise on Passover, that he not eat leavened bread in the place that is under his authority — and this is the sense of בכל גבולך:"], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:34:05.687765388Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}